flowchart TD
    A[A/B Testing with Amazon SageMaker] --> B[Prerequisites & Configuration]
    B --> C[Step 1: Create and Deploy Models]
    C --> C1[Upload pre-trained models to S3]
    C1 --> C2[Create model definitions]
    C2 --> C3[Create variants with equal weights]
    C3 --> C4[Deploy endpoint with both variants]
    
    C4 --> D[Step 2: Invoke Deployed Models]
    D --> D1[Send test traffic to endpoint]
    D1 --> D2[Monitor invocations per variant]
    D2 --> D3[Invoke specific variant for testing]
    
    D3 --> E[Step 3: Evaluate Variant Performance]
    E --> E1[Evaluate Variant1 metrics]
    E1 --> E2[Evaluate Variant2 metrics]
    E2 --> E3[Compare performance metrics]
    
    E3 --> F[Step 4: Dial Up Chosen Variant]
    F --> F1[Update weights to 25%/75% split]
    F1 --> F2[Observe traffic distribution]
    F2 --> F3[Update weights to 0%/100% to chosen variant]
    F3 --> F4[Confirm all traffic to better model]
    
    F4 --> G[Clean Up - Delete Endpoint]